  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultancy for formulation of support for WRI 2023-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the consultancy is to assist the Ministry of Foreign Affairs in the preparation of a project for the next engagement with the World Resources Institute (WRI) in support of WRI&apos;s next strategic program (2023-2027). 

The consultant will support the process, by analysing and summarizing background documents in the process of formulating the documentation for the program committee. Following, the consultancy will be penholder on writing the project document and its annexes.

The consultant will report directly to the project manager in the Department for Green Diplomacy and Climate (GDK) and assist with preparation of inputs for project documentation.</narrative>
  </description>
